      "description": "beloud.now is a simple way to share experiences and make places of concern visible — anonymously.\n\nPlace a point on the map to mark something you experienced. No registration. No personal data.\n\nThe app helps highlight locations where people feel unsafe, raising awareness for situations that often remain unseen.\n\nFeatures:\n• Anonymous sharing of experiences\n• Map with marked locations\n• Quick and easy to use\n• No account required\n\nbeloud.now is for anyone who wants to share experiences — safely, anonymously, and without barriers.\n\nThis app is for awareness purposes only and is not intended for emergency reporting or contacting law enforcement.",
